1. Check RuntimeWatchdogSec in the watchdog drop-in file "/etc/systemd/system.conf.d/watchdog.conf";
   set it to 0 and reboot before testing this watchdog sample code.
 
2. Compile:
   # gcc wdt.c -o wdt

3. Test: (default: 60 seconds, if there is no timeout value as input parameter)
   # sudo ./wdt <timeout in seconds>

   => System will reboot automatically after timeout
